## Usage

```bash
make dev      # http://127.0.0.1:8501, rerunning the page on every save
```

<!-- stacks:fill Where the data comes from and how it gets into the app. -->

Settings come from `{{env_prefix}}_*` environment variables or a `.env` file (see `.env.example`). `PORT_WEB` and `WEB_HOST` choose where `make dev` and `make start` listen.

## Development

Requires [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) and make.

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `make install` | Create `.venv` and install the project and its dev tools |
| `make lint` / `make format` | Check / fix lint and formatting (ruff) |
| `make typecheck` | mypy strict over `app.py`, the package and the tests |
| `make coverage` | Tests, including the page through Streamlit's AppTest, with the coverage floor |
| `make start` | Serve the app as a deploy would |

Run `make help` for the full list. [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) maps the modules.
